## Modules

- `config.lua` — Earth watchlist + Moon hardware (`bridge` / `modem`) via `cfg_pipe`
- `protocol.lua` — ender rednet stock query
- `ae_bridge.lua` — getItem / exportItem / craftItem / craftable / `snapshot` (AP 0.7)
- `railgun_hw.lua` — loader full + relay pulse (from legacy `railgun`)
- `discover.lua` — bridge, modem, monitor, buffer, loaders, relay
- `planner.lua` — ALARM/WARN, package, craft-wait policy
- `monitor_ui.lua` — Earth status: Предмет/Луна/Цель red <25% / yellow <100% / green ≥100%; Земля white; Статус «Крафт (n)» / «Загрузка (n)» yellow, on cooldown «Отправлено (n)» yellow, «Нет в AE» red; header tracks craft + staged totals + blocking `wait_item`; **2 fixed sys/error lines**; sticky column widths; per-line paint cache; `setTextScale` once per monitor name. Row **order is fixed** (caller skeleton); draw does not re-sort
- Earth entry: `uiRows` skeleton from cfg.items (fingerprint); ticks only patch statuses. **Cfg hot-reload** each poll (`loadEarth`): watchlist fingerprint change rebuilds the skeleton; bridge/monitor/loaders/relay/buffer/modem change sets dirty rescan. Tunables (cooldown, craft_wait, red_frac, …) apply immediately. Parallel UI + control

## Deploy

```text
python tools/bundle_project.py moon_supply moon_supply_E_ctrl
python tools/bundle_project.py moon_supply moon_supply_M_probe
```

Copy `dist/moon_supply_E_ctrl.lua` + `dist/moon_supply_E_ctrl.cfg` (Earth). Copy `dist/moon_supply_M_probe.lua` + `dist/moon_supply_M_probe.cfg` (Moon). Edit `.cfg` in-game as needed; no buffer chest required.
